subject: Enable Android DevTools on phones

Turn on the on-device DevTools, with a flag to turn it off, and drop the tablet-only
checks. Developer tools and Task manager go in a More tools submenu on phones, and
tapping More tools again closes its flyout. DevTools only loads its built-in frontend.
Based on Cromite, Aerium, Titanium and Ultimatum.
